<div align="center">

# 🏛️ Civic AI Suite
### AI-Powered Autonomous Digital Government Platform

[![React](https://img.shields.io/badge/React_18-20232A?style=for-the-badge&logo=react&logoColor=61DAFB)](https://reactjs.org/)
