## 📌 Table of Contents
1. [Overview](#-overview)
2. [The Six Autonomous Agents](#-the-six-autonomous-agents)
3. [Core Features](#-core-features)
4. [Tech Stack](#-tech-stack)
5. [System Architecture](#-system-architecture)
6. [Database Schema](#-database-schema)
